Package: vidub
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: ViDub Contributors
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), libxcb1, libxkbcommon0, libgl1
Recommends: mpv, ffmpeg
Description: ViDub — local video dubbing (Vietnamese TTS)
 ViDub dubs local video and YouTube/Bilibili content into Vietnamese
 speech: transcript (captions, then Whisper STT), translation via
 NVIDIA NIM, OpenRouter, or Google Gemini, Piper text-to-speech with
 the bundled ngochuyennew voice, and same-length WAV sync with ffmpeg export.
 .
 Bundled sidecars live in /usr/lib/vidub/bin (yt-dlp, ffmpeg, ffprobe,
 piper + espeak-ng-data, qjs) and the voice in /usr/lib/vidub/models.
 Preview needs a system mpv (Recommends: mpv) — export works without it.
 .
 __ARCH__ build. Licenses: /usr/lib/vidub/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
